{
  "slug": "biocharpro",
  "name": "Biocharpro",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Bring Biochar Optimizer Pro into Claude — pyrolysis simulation, feedstock comparison, AI-powered lab-analysis PDF extraction, and multi-methodology scoring against Puro.earth, Isometric, Verra VM0044, EBC and Gold Standard. Exposed as 4 MCP tools. Requires a biocharpro.io Developer-tier API key.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `compare-feedstocks` (Use when the user wants to compare multiple biochar feedstocks side-by-side at the same pyrolysis temperature and residence…), `extract-lab-analysis` (Use when the user has a lab-analysis PDF of biomass or biochar and wants the numbers parsed into…), `list-feedstocks` (Use when the user wants to see what feedstocks are available on biocharpro, or when you need to…), `simulate-biochar` (Use when the user asks about biochar properties (carbon content, yield, H/Corg ratio, BET surface, pH, CO₂e credits)…)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `biocharpro`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install biocharpro@claude-community` from `pablokohan30-ux/biocharpro-claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
